# Searches pc reported in Vulnerabilities, also it includes severity and ensure that device count is explicitly unique:
DeviceTvmSoftwareVulnerabilities
| where DeviceName startswith "PC"
| summarize
    AffectedDevices = dcount(DeviceId)
    by CveId, VulnerabilitySeverityLevel, SoftwareName, SoftwareVendor // SoftwareVersion
| order by AffectedDevices desc
